    "innovation": "This paper compares the impact of CMIP3 and CMIP5 climate model ensembles on Central Asian glaciers, finding the resulting uncertainty in future glacier extent is similar for both, and that model parameter uncertainty is as important as uncertainty in the climate projections.",
